    "type": "question",
    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "65 376 tickets were sold for a concert. The venue had seating for 75 000 people. How many more tickets could be sold to fill every seat?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "9624 tickets",
      "worked": "Regroup 75 000 as 6 ten-thousands, 14 thousands, 9 hundreds, 9 tens and 10 ones.\n$$\\begin{array}{r r r r r r}&6&14&9&9&10\\\\-&6&5&3&7&6\\\\\\hline&&9&6&2&4\\end{array}$$\n9624 more tickets could be sold.",
